# AI Vibe Writing — compatibility entry

Read `SKILL.md` beside this file and follow its task routing and path conventions. Load only the selected prompts; this file adds no separate writing pipeline.

- Keep existing numbered prompt paths available for direct calls.
- Grammar-only requests use the minimal correction route. Formal reviewer responses use `16_response_letter_agent.md`; author-style learning uses `1_style_extractor.md`.
- Use current-session authorization. An authorized rewrite does not require an extra approval just because it is extensive.
- Keep manuscript evidence, reviewer material, author profiles, and task memory in the author's current paper workspace. The public skill repository contains reusable instructions and templates.
